  "written_results": [
    "For x>=1, N=floor(x), U=floor(sqrt(x))=isqrt(N): mu(n)=2*mu(n)*1_(n<=U)-sum_(a,b<=U,ab|n)mu(a)mu(b) for 1<=n<=N. The support condition N<(U+1)^2 is strict.",
    "Literal W(t)=P(t)-B(exp(t)), with P(t)=2*sum_(a<=floor(exp(t/2)))mu(a)h_a(t) and the full ordered a,b,k divisor kernel B.",
    "Unconditional written bound |P(t)|<=8*(exp(t/4)-1); int_0^T exp(-2*t/3)*P(t)^2 dt<=864/5.",
    "Writing K(T)=int_0^T exp(-2*t/3)*B(exp(t))^2 dt: |sqrt(H_(1/3)(T))-sqrt(K(T))|<=sqrt(864/5); hence H<=2*K+1728/5 and K<=2*H+1728/5.",
    "The strict kernel at x=4 has determinant -(sqrt(2)-1)^2<0, although its 2,2 entry vanishes. It is not a Gram matrix.",
    "Sparse e1 comparison source gives B_*(exp(t))>=exp(t/2)-1 and infinite one-third weighted energy. Thus bounded-coefficient/operator-only suppliers are rejected, not the actual Mobius target.",
    "The still-unpaid critical logarithmic supplier |B(x)|<=C*x^(1/3)/(1+log(x))^(1/2+epsilon) would give K<=C^2/(2*epsilon)."
  ],
